# ============================================================================
#  Zarvan Calendar — what does not belong in the repository
# ============================================================================
#
#  NOTE: dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the product — the folder a
#  consumer downloads and drops into their project. Commit it on every release.
#  See README.md ▸ Install.
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Generated intermediates -------------------------------------------------
# Assembled from build/manifest-{js,css}.txt on the way to dist/. Nothing loads
# them: every page in this repo points at dist/. They are byte-identical to
# their dist/ counterparts (the CSS literally so), so committing them would
# duplicate ~240 KB and produce a merge conflict on every PR that touches a
# part. Run any of the three builders to regenerate.
src/js/zarvan.js
src/css/zarvan.css

# --- Optional dev-only dependency --------------------------------------------
# SheetJS is not a dependency of this library — the Excel export resolves it at
# click time from options.deps.xlsx or window.XLSX, and warns if it is absent.
# The demo pages load it from a CDN. Drop a copy here if you want it offline.
src/libs/xlsx.full.min.js

# --- Local tooling -----------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Node --------------------------------------------------------------------
# There are no runtime dependencies; this is only here for anyone who runs the
# optional node build or the dev server.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log
*.log

# --- OS ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Scratch -----------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
